guide forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills
title Hillsbrad Foothills, Undercity & The Barrens
faction Horde
levels 24-28
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
next forever/horde/07-ashenvale

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route (export
# consensus-horde-tauren, visits 10-12) and Era-baseline reference data;
# not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Flow: Tarren Mill (bind again: the last guide binds here) -> the hills west of town (bears,
# creepers, lions) -> Hillsbrad Fields (farmers) -> Tarren Mill -> Stanley
# and the southern fields (peasants, skulls) -> Tarren Mill -> the Syndicate
# camps, Durnholde Keep, Deathstalker Masoj and the Mudsnout Blossoms ->
# hearth to Tarren Mill -> the smithy -> Tarren Mill -> the town hall ->
# hearth -> Azurelode Mine -> Tarren Mill -> fly to the Undercity (Elixir of
# Agony, training) ->
# zeppelin to Orgrimmar (Hunters and Shamans train; Druids fly to Thunder
# Bluff to train), fly to Camp Taurajo (bind) ->
# Bael Modan (Tear of the Moons) -> Grish Longrunner at the Great Lift ->
# hearth to Camp Taurajo -> fly to Ratchet: Mahren Skyseer, Isha Awak,
# Sputtervalve -> forever/horde/07-ashenvale.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Elixir of Agony (509) and Dangerous! (567) have no prerequisite and are
#   taken on arrival: the Mudsnout Blossoms grow beside the Durnholde trip and
#   the Dangerous! targets stand in Hillsbrad town, the fields and the mine
#   that the Battle of Hillsbrad chain visits anyway. The export takes them at
#   26.6 and walks every area a second time.
# - The Durnholde trip comes after the first western loop, and the hearth is
#   used from the Mudsnout Blossoms and from the town hall.
# - Time To Strike (494) is handed in on arrival (picked up at Southpoint
#   Tower in the previous guide; the export picks it up in Tarren Mill).
# - Stanley and the peasants (Battle of Hillsbrad part II, 528) come before
#   the Durnholde trip: Darthalia offers Scout Support (98094) only once 528
#   is handed in (#148, and a Wowhead Forever comment; the quest data has no
#   prerequisite for it), and Masoj stands on that trip. Sim compare (Orc):
#   +0.005 h to 26, -0.004 h to 30 against the old order.
# - Free at Last (4904): the export picks it up from Lakota Windsong near the
#   Great Lift; she is held captive on Darkcloud Pinnacle in Thousand
#   Needles, so the next guide picks it up and escorts her in one go.
# - No Undercity or Ratchet binds: the export replaces both before using them.
# - Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills (493) is handed in only by characters who
#   came through Silverpine Forest.
#
# Carried on: Elixir of Agony (515: the scales and eyes are on the Hillsbrad
# coast, at about 32).
#
# Left out: A New Ore Sample (1153): the export picks it up at Camp Taurajo
# and never hands it in. Melor Sends Word (1130): its turn-in in Thunder
# Bluff at 30 is not on the route any more. Blood of Innocents (1066) needs
# Journey to Tarren Mill (1065), from Zamah's chain in Thunder Bluff, which
# this route never runs. Unending Torment (97289-97292): re-checked for the
# new consensus route, which did all four in the Undercity at about 21
# because QuestieDB lists no prerequisite for them; but 97289 asks for the
# Head of the Baron, and the chain starts from the Abominable Head (97288), a
# drop from The Baron in the Ruins of Lordaeron dungeon, so they stay out
# (tools/lib/data/corrections.json now links 97288 -> 97289 -> ... -> 97292).
# Valuable Vantages (98095, Forever, Masoj's follow-up to Scout Support):
# the new consensus route takes it, but its three vial spots (the hills by
# Dun Garok, the plateau over Durnholde, the Headland ridge above Hillsbrad,
# per its quest text) have no coordinates in the data or any source we
# could read, so it is left out until they are placed.
#
# Added: Scout Support (98094, Forever): Darthalia's orders for Deathstalker
# Masoj, who hides on the way from Durnholde to the Mudsnout Blossoms.
#
# Class training: in the Undercity at 26-27 for Warriors, Paladins, Rogues,
# Priests, Mages and Warlocks (no Hunter, Shaman or Druid trainer there);
# Hunters and Shamans train in Orgrimmar on the way through, Druids fly from
# Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff before Camp Taurajo.
#
# Class quests: Shaman Call of Water (1536, from the previous guide): fill
# the waterskin at the Spring Well in Tarren Mill and hand it to Brine south
# of Camp Taurajo, who gives the blue waterskin (1534) for the Ruins of
# Stardust in forever/horde/07-ashenvale. Rogues who finished Mission:
# Possible But Not Probable hand Hinott's Assistance (2479, 2480, optional:
# Gallywix is elite) to Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill and learn Poisons. Those
# who skipped Gallywix are pointed at the Class guide Poisons (Horde)
# (forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde): 2479 needs 2478 turned in.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  tip Tarren Mill is your base for this guide: the hearth brings you back here twice. Everyone stands around the town square.
  sethome "Tarren Mill" npc 2388      -- Innkeeper Shay: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  turnin 493                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  turnin 494                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 498                          -- Krusk
  accept 549                          -- The WANTED poster by the inn
  accept 567                          -- The Dangerous! poster: its targets come up along the way
  accept 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 501
  accept 509
  collect 7771 quest 1536 only Shaman -- Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well beside the inn

step Serge Hinott
  only Rogue
  tip Only if Gallywix fell in the Barrens (Mission: Possible But Not Probable): Serge Hinott stands in Tarren Mill. Wait beside him while he brews the cure, then take your reward: Poisons.
  turnin 2479 optional                -- Serge Hinott
  accept 2480 optional
  complete 2480 optional
  turnin 2480 optional                -- Serge Hinott: Poisons
  note "No Gallywix yet? The Class guide Poisons (Horde) runs the chain from Shenthul again, with a group for Gallywix."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: the hills and Hillsbrad Fields

step Bears, creepers and lions
  tip West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears, Forest Moss Creepers and Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one.
  collect 3476 quest 496.1
  collect 3477 quest 496.2
  collect 3496 quest 501.1

step Hillsbrad Fields
  tip The farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere. Farmer Kalaba tends the field south of the farms.
  kill 2360 quest 527.2
  kill 2266 quest 527.1
  kill 232 quest 527.3
  kill 2403 quest 527.4
  kill 2451 quest 567.4

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 499
  turnin 499                          -- Umpi, next to Lydon
  turnin 501                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 502
  turnin 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 528
  accept 546                          -- Deathguard Samsa

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: Stanley, peasants and skulls

step Stanley
  tip Stanley is Farmer Ray's dog, at the northern farmhouse in Hillsbrad Fields.
  turnin 502

step Peasants and skulls
  tip The Peasants work the fields south of the farmhouses. Every Hillsbrad human drops skulls; the Peasants drop them most often.
  kill 2267 quest 528.1
  collect 3692 quest 546.1 @30.3,40.3 -- Hillsbrad Human Skull: the Peasants in the fields

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 528                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 529
  turnin 546                          -- Deathguard Samsa
  accept 98094 npc 2215               -- High Executor Darthalia: orders for Deathstalker Masoj, on the way to Durnholde

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East: Durnholde

step Syndicate camps
  tip From Tarren Mill go south-east into the hills on the way to Durnholde Keep. Rogues and Watchmen hold the camps along the way.
  kill 2260 quest 549.1
  kill 2261 quest 549.2

step Durnholde Keep
  tip Drull and Tog'thar are chained inside Durnholde Keep's courtyard buildings; open both locks.
  interact 1721 quest 498.1           -- Drull's ball and chain
  interact 1722 quest 498.2           -- Tog'thar's ball and chain

step Deathstalker Masoj
  tip Masoj hides on the hillside above Dun Garok, south of Durnholde, on the way down to the blossoms.
  turnin 98094 npc 270438 @64.2,54.0  -- Deathstalker Masoj

step Mudsnout Blossoms
  tip South-west of Durnholde, the Mudsnout Blossoms grow on the hillsides above the river.
  collect 3502 quest 509

step Tarren Mill
  hearth "Tarren Mill"
  turnin 549                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  turnin 498                          -- Krusk
  turnin 509                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 513                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Undercity

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hillsbrad

step The smithy
  tip The smithy stands in the middle of Hillsbrad town. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks the street north of it.
  kill 2404 quest 529.1
  kill 2265 quest 529.2
  collect 3564 quest 529.3
  kill 2449 quest 567.2

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 529                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 532

step Town hall
  tip The town hall is on the west side of Hillsbrad. Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town.
  kill 2335 quest 532.1
  kill 2387 quest 532.2
  collect 3657 quest 532.4
  interact 1761 quest 532.3           -- Hillsbrad Proclamation
  kill 2448 quest 567.1

step Tarren Mill
  hearth "Tarren Mill"
  turnin 532                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 539

step Azurelode Mine
  tip The Azurelode Mine lies south of Hillsbrad town. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside.
  kill 2269 quest 539.2
  kill 2305 quest 539.1
  kill 2450 quest 567.3

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 539                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  turnin 567

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity

step Master Apothecary Faranell
  zone Undercity
  fly "Undercity"
  turnin 513                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Apothecarium
  accept 515                          -- Keep it: the Hillsbrad coast, later on the route
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Barrens

step Orgrimmar
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Take the zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity to Orgrimmar and train before you fly on.
  train class

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip From Orgrimmar (zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity) fly to Thunder Bluff and train on Elder Rise, then fly on to Camp Taurajo.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Camp Taurajo
  zone The Barrens
  tip From Orgrimmar (zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity) fly to Camp Taurajo.
  fly "Camp Taurajo"
  sethome "Camp Taurajo"
  accept 874                          -- Jorn Skyseer

step Brine
  only Shaman
  tip Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole, south of Camp Taurajo, on the way to Bael Modan.
  turnin 1536                         -- Brine: the red waterskin from Tarren Mill
  accept 1534                         -- Brine: the blue waterskin is filled in Ashenvale, next guide

step Tear of the Moons
  tip Follow the road south to the dwarf dig site at Bael Modan. Feegly the Exiled hides at the south edge of the dig; General Twinbraid's Strongbox sits at the bottom of the excavation.
  accept 857                          -- Feegly the Exiled
  collect 5038 quest 857 @49.1,84.3   -- General Twinbraid's Strongbox
  turnin 857

step Great Lift
  tip South-west of Bael Modan, Grish Longrunner waits at the top of the Great Lift.
  turnin 5881                         -- Grish Longrunner

step Merchant Coast
  tip Hearth to Camp Taurajo and fly to Ratchet. Mahren Skyseer camps on the shore north of Ratchet.
  hearth "Camp Taurajo"
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 874                          -- Mahren Skyseer
  accept 873

step Isha Awak
  tip Isha Awak, a big threshadon, swims in the shallows off the Merchant Coast, east of Mahren.
  collect 5104 quest 873

step Ratchet
  turnin 873                          -- Mahren Skyseer
  turnin 1094                         -- Sputtervalve, by the docks in Ratchet
  vendor nearest
